                             Find command

--> to find/search file use find command
syntax:
       find  <location>  <options>  <expression>

here,
<location>: where to search file (/ means whole system or /etc)
<options>: filtering data
<expression>: actions

options:
1. -name : by name
2. -size : by size
16M +16M -16M
3. -perm: by permission
4. -mtime: by modification time
5. -user
6. -group
7. -uid
8. -gid

condition
n = exact time
+n = older than n
-n = newer than n 


